# The embedded font pack's groups (cmake/FontPack.cmake; stx_fontpack/README.md
# describes the format). Every face of bundled-fonts.sha256 goes to the first
# group with a pattern matching its file name. An eager group is decoded the
# first time the application asks for any face; a lazy group the first time it
# asks for one of that group's faces. A face matching no group, or a group
# matching no face, fails the build.
#
# The interface faces draw every window from its first frame: all Portsmouth
# faces (Portsmouth Mono among them) and Carlito.
group interface eager
Portsmouth*.ttf
Carlito-*.ttf
# The monospace role's faces, apart so the other families stay undecoded until
# text names them.
group monospace lazy
Cousine-*.ttf
# The families with faces of their own (the registry's Selawik, Selawik
# Semibold, Arimo and Tinos).
group families lazy
Selawik-*.ttf
Arimo-*.ttf
Tinos-*.ttf
# The fallback faces (GUI_FORMS_INSTALL_FALLBACK_FONTS), each group decoded
# when text first needs a character only it covers.
group scripts lazy
NotoSansArabic-*.ttf
NotoSansHebrew-*.ttf
NotoSansDevanagari-*.ttf
NotoSansBengali-*.ttf
NotoSansGurmukhi-*.ttf
group emoji lazy
NotoEmoji-*.ttf
group cjk lazy
NotoSansCJK*
